# OS files
Thumbs.db
ehthumbs.db
Desktop.ini

## .NET Core Specifics
# User-secrets
secrets.json

# Auto-generated assembly attributes (Sürekli değişen hashlerin kaynağı)
**/[Aa]ssembly*/
Properties/AssemblyInfo.cs

# Backup and Publishing outputs
*.publishsettings
*.pubxml
*.pubxml.user